# 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| 📗 **Microsoft Excel** | Data understanding, validation & quality checks |
| 🗄️ **MySQL / SQL** | Database design, ingestion & analysis |
| 🐍 **Python** | Data cleaning, EDA, statistics & segmentation |
| 🐼 **Pandas** | Data manipulation |
| 🔢 **NumPy** | Numerical analysis |
| 📊 **Matplotlib / Seaborn** | Data visualization |
| 📐 **SciPy / Statsmodels** | Statistical & hypothesis testing |
| 🤖 **Scikit-learn** | Predictive modeling |
| 📊 **Power BI / Tableau** | Interactive dashboards |
| 💻 **GitHub** | Documentation & version control |

